#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:1 d60a7bd0c97845ad848246dba8747a95
msgid "📦 [Bookshelf - 3.2.0](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/releases/tag/v3.2.0)"
msgstr "📦 [Bookshelf - 3.2.0](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/releases/tag/v3.2.0)"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:3 d36848a8e5d441878bc9049edb25d1f3
msgid "**🧱 The Block Update!**"
msgstr "**🧱 方块更新！**"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:5 e1eb96f591cd4634b0d1053077665b7e
msgid "*Introduces new block data and deprecates several older features in preparation for the future.*"
msgstr "*引入新的方块数据，并弃用若干旧功能，为未来做准备。*"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:7 349f3b46ec9e4c8599c317a57c4cfda8
msgid "Bookshelf is now based on **Minecraft 1.21.9-1.21.11**."
msgstr "Bookshelf 现在基于 **Minecraft 1.21.9-1.21.11**。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:9 001fba39dbb84e4d9ef878bcdbf814db
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#403](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/403)** - Added the `#bs.load:status` function to view loaded modules."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新特性\">✨</abbr> **[#403](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/403)** - 添加了 `#bs.load:status` 函数以查看已加载的模块。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:10 cb24b51438de414c8fb67e2987e15e07
msgid "<abbr title=\"Enhancements\">⚡</abbr> **[#501](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/501)** - Optimized tp commands used in macros."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"增强\">⚡</abbr> **[#501](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/501)** - 优化了宏中使用的 tp 命令。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:11 5fc9db6ad29a4117b54795490aa1bf99
msgid "<abbr title=\"Enhancements\">⚡</abbr> **[#501](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/506)** - Reduce NBT writing and remove a few macros."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"增强\">⚡</abbr> **[#501](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/506)** - 减少 NBT 写入并移除少量宏。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:12 763183bcce014897ba65a1605dad4d27
msgid "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#501](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/501)** - Ensure sculk sensors are not triggered when markers are killed."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"错误修复\">🐛</abbr> **[#501](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/501)** - 确保标记被杀死时不会触发 sculk 传感器。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:14 4572bd18cfc742e5a144b8b45af8bf14
msgid "`🧱 bs.block`"
msgstr "`🧱 bs.block`"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:16 6647e12e87ad49ee8378b8bcabf14072
msgid "<abbr title=\"Deprecations\">🗑️</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - Deprecated `play_block_sound` in favor of more granular functions (`play_break_sound`, etc.)."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"弃用\">🗑️</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - 已弃用 `play_block_sound`，改用更细粒度的函数（`play_break_sound` 等）。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:17 65b4414f1fd7427e8c2a541f1c063933
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#496](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/496)** - Added new predicates: `is_conductive`, `is_powered`, `is_spawnable`, `is_strongly_powered`, and `is_weakly_powered`."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新功能\">✨</abbr> **[#496](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/496)** - 新增谓词：`is_conductive`、`is_powered`、`is_spawnable`、`is_strongly_powered` 和 `is_weakly_powered`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:18 eb5f49bead8d4799a0b465c38ef475f2
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#496](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/496)** - Added new functions: `is_touching_power`, `is_touching_strong_power`, and `is_touching_weak_power`."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新功能\">✨</abbr> **[#496](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/496)** - 新增函数：`is_touching_power`、`is_touching_strong_power` 和 `is_touching_weak_power`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:19 0255d2d83a624d429d8e4934411144a1
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - Added new block property functions: `get_blast_resistance`, `get_friction`, `get_hardness`, `get_instrument`, `get_jump_factor`, `get_luminance`, `get_sounds`, and `get_speed_factor`."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新功能\">✨</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - 新增方块属性函数：`get_blast_resistance`、`get_friction`、`get_hardness`、`get_instrument`、`get_jump_factor`、`get_luminance`、`get_sounds` 和 `get_speed_factor`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:20 61fff529ec2640f886a73944d1bde6c8
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - Added new block sound functions: `play_break_sound`, `play_hit_sound`, `play_fall_sound`, `play_place_sound`, and `play_step_sound`."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新功能\">✨</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - 新增方块音效函数：`play_break_sound`、`play_hit_sound`、`play_fall_sound`、`play_place_sound` 和 `play_step_sound`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:21 20306f2e59624397ad000979c93aded8
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - Added new block tags: `can_occlude` and `ignited_by_lava`."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新功能\">✨</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - 新增块标签：`can_occlude` 和 `ignited_by_lava`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:22 98a4fe7c226a4c92a4876c5c03f89e12
msgid "<abbr title=\"Enhancements\">⚡</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - Modified `emit_block_particle` to support a default `type`, aligning it with the new block sound function behavior."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"改进\">⚡</abbr> **[#489](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/489)** - 修改了 `emit_block_particle`，以支持默认的 `type`，使其与新的方块音效函数行为保持一致。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:25 181266b1a49f4ab3b2727bf3b79780d9
msgid "`🎯 bs.environment`"
msgstr "`🎯 bs.environment`"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:27 8b37411fa2b1415597c82708ed769075
msgid "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#501](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/501)** - Fixed `look_at` functions teleporting the player to the current execution position."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#501](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/501)** - 修复了 `look_at` 函数将玩家传送至当前执行位置的问题。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:30 52cb5cfbb48c43b5aff8601171e1c915
msgid "`🎯 bs.hitbox`"
msgstr "`🎯 bs.hitbox`"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:32 21b8c27e02144102812048489612a12d
msgid "<abbr title=\"Deprecations\">🗑️</abbr> **[#484](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/484)** - Block tag `has_offset` has been **deprecated** and will be removed in a v4.0.0. Please use `has_shape_offset` instead."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Deprecations\">🗑️</abbr> **[#484](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/484)** - 方块标签 `has_offset` 已被**弃用**，将在 v4.0.0 中移除。请改用 `has_shape_offset`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:33 7e85df02e7db4cf4804a5fad6cb20e89
msgid "<abbr title=\"Deprecations\">🗑️</abbr> **[#484](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/484)** - Function `#bs.hitbox:get_block` has been **deprecated** and will be removed in a v4.0.0. Please use `#bs.hitbox:get_block_shape` or `#bs.hitbox:get_block_collision` instead."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Deprecations\">🗑️</abbr> **[#484](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/484)** - 函数 `#bs.hitbox:get_block` 已被**弃用**，将在 v4.0.0 中移除。请改用 `#bs.hitbox:get_block_shape` 或 `#bs.hitbox:get_block_collision`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:34 dc2ef408284d4e11a0d119e6190c8549
msgid "<abbr title=\"Deprecations\">🗑️</abbr> **[#484](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/484)** - Functions `#bs.hitbox:is_entity_in_block_interaction`, `#bs.hitbox:is_entity_in_blocks_interaction`, and `#bs.hitbox:is_in_block_interaction` have been **deprecated** and will be removed in a v4.0.0. Please use `#bs.hitbox:is_entity_in_block_shape`, `#bs.hitbox:is_entity_in_blocks_shape`, or `#bs.hitbox:is_in_block_shape` instead."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Deprecations\">🗑️</abbr> **[#484](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/484)** - 函数 `#bs.hitbox:is_entity_in_block_interaction`、`#bs.hitbox:is_entity_in_blocks_interaction` 和 `#bs.hitbox:is_in_block_interaction` 已被**弃用**，将在 v4.0.0 中移除。请改用 `#bs.hitbox:is_entity_in_block_shape`、`#bs.hitbox:is_entity_in_blocks_shape` 或 `#bs.hitbox:is_in_block_shape`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:35 d3137d930dca48f0ab24b0cf1778c608
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#502](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/502)** - Added new 1.21.11 entities."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#502](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/502)** - 新增了 1.21.11 版本的实体。"

