msgid "`🏃 bs.move`"
msgstr "`🏃 bs.move`"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:40 e68517a0eb864710bf6924352d59b019
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#473](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/473)** - Added custom block hitboxes and soft collisions."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新功能\">✨</abbr> **[#473](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/473)** - 添加了自定义方块碰撞箱和软碰撞。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:41 5f11df2278c84bc68f989638cfbf68aa
msgid "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#487](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/487)** - Prevented false collisions on zero-velocity axes with partial blocks such as slabs."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"漏洞修复\">🐛</abbr> **[#487](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/487)** - 修复了在使用台阶等部分方块时，零速度轴上的错误碰撞。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:44 d134e18c2a744fcc8797e927a177984b
msgid "`🔦 bs.raycast`"
msgstr "`🔦 bs.raycast`"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:46 378968af5e1541b783115f9df9bb5eea
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#473](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/473)** - Added custom block hitboxes and improved multi-layer piercing."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新功能\">✨</abbr> **[#473](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/473)** - 添加了自定义方块碰撞箱并改进了多层穿透。"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:49 4b13bf6e432c4d4b833a1a8767569616
msgid "`👀 bs.view`"
msgstr "`👀 bs.view`"

#: ../../../changelog/v3.2.0.md:51 71e7632e0e19416388dd17a8d6b8a176
msgid "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#498](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/498)** - Fixed `#bs.view:at_block_placement` to match vanilla placement behavior for special blocks such as cauldrons, hoppers, composters, and scaffolding."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"漏洞修复\">🐛</abbr> **[#498](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/498)** - 修复了`#bs.view:at_block_placement`，使其与炼药锅、漏斗、堆肥桶和脚手架等特殊方块的原版放置行为一致。"
